        "pageid": 72431743,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Choo-Choo Charles",
        "extract": "Choo-Choo Charles is a 2022 survival horror game developed and published by Two Star Games. The player controls a monster-hunting archivist with the goal of upgrading their train's defenses in order to fight and defeat the titular character, Charles, an evil spider-train hybrid monster that wanders the landscape looking for people to eat.\nAfter the first trailer was released in 2021, it went viral on the Internet, provoking reactions on websites such as Twitter and Reddit. This led the game to receive a spot in Time's list of most anticipated 2022 video games. The game received mixed reviews from critics.",
